    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at using an opponent's defense to your own advantage.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot\" title=\"Point-Blank Shot\">Point-Blank Shot</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Precise_Shot\" title=\"Precise Shot\">Precise Shot</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +4</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever an opponent attacks you while in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> provided by another character, creature, or Droid, you are treated as being in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> from attacks by that opponent.</p>",
